            "review_text": "Hiro\n136 contributions\n1\nCosy Japanese Restaurant With Great Presentation\nSep 2019 • Friends\nI had zaru soba noodle and fried soft shell crab salad. Soba noodle was on ice so it's cold. That's what I wanted on a hot day. Fried soft crab was juicy too. Price was reasonable given its quality and presentation. Staff are very attentive and pleasant. They do delivery with some apps as well. So it would be convenient to get the food delivered when raining too. Will come back.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 11, 2019",
